# Supabase Postgres connection (transaction pooler, port 6543)
# Supabase dashboard -> Connect -> Connection string -> Transaction pooler.
# Put your DB password in place of [YOUR-PASSWORD]. If the password contains
# special chars (@ / : # ?), percent-encode them or reset to alphanumeric.
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres.PROJECTREF:[YOUR-PASSWORD]@aws-0-REGION.pooler.supabase.com:6543/postgres

# Hugging Face fine-grained token, scope: "Make calls to Inference Providers"
# Required for Phase 4 (synthesis). Create at https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens
# Also request access to gated models: https://huggingface.co/meta-llama/Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct
HF_TOKEN=